===Head to the Palace of Astrum to see the General{{subst:void|<!--202200801-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=continuance|location=Palace of Astrum|With Yanqing welcoming you, you returned to the Xianzhou Luofu, where you have been away for a &mdash; um, not a particularly long time &mdash; to participate in the upcoming Wardance.<br />The general awaits your arrival in the Palace of Astrum. What kind of task will he use to "welcome" the guests from the Express? Just thinking about it is making you feel the tiniest bit of flutter.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Yanqing:''' General, I've brought our guests from the Express. I'm sorry for my bad timing. I didn't know you were meeting a guest, General.
:'''Jing Yuan:''' Don't worry. You're just in time. It's been a while, my friends from the Astral Express!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How's everything going, General?
::'''Jing Yuan:''' All is well when you have friends coming from afar.
::I dreamed about you on Penacony.
::'''Jing Yuan:''' Oh? Well It's an honor to be in your dreams, my friend.
::Did you miss us?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I dreamed about you on Penacony.
::'''Jing Yuan:''' Oh? Well It's an honor to be in your dreams, my friend.
::Did you miss us?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Did you miss us?
:'''Jing Yuan:''' Sure, how couldn't I have? It's not often we find such moments to reunite and enjoy one another's presence.
:'''March 7th:''' Since when did (Trailblazer) and General Jing Yuan become such good buddies, Dan Heng? They seem to be having a great time.
:'''Dan Heng:''' A lot must have happened without our knowledge. At least I hope that's the case...
:'''Jing Yuan:''' Allow me to introduce you to General Huaiyan. He's the Arbiter-General of the Xianzhou Zhuming, known as the Flaming Heart.
:'''Huaiyan:''' Hehe, no need to be so formal. I'm just a tourist here, no different from other tourists who've come to attend the ceremony.
:'''Jing Yuan:''' Elder Huaiyan is not only one of the Arbiter-Generals but also the Furnace Master of the Artisanship Commission. Besides his martial skills, he excels in forging various weapons. Such talents are unique, even among the Arbiter-Generals.
:'''Huaiyan:''' Be it Arbiter-General or Furnace Master, these are merely titles given to me long ago. I've retired several times already, but with the current change in circumstances, the Marshal has called me back to duty, and I had no choice but to answer the call.
:'''Huaiyan:''' Well, in the end, I'm to blame. Living such a long life naturally brings its share of disapproval.
:'''Dan Heng & Yanqing:''' It's an honor to meet you, General Huaiyan.
:'''March 7th:''' It's my honor to meet you, General Huaiyan...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Glad to meet you, General.
:'''Huaiyan:''' No need to be all formal. Today I'm just a guest on the Luofu, the same as all of you.
:{{tx}}
:{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

===Leave the Palace of Astrum with Yanqing{{subst:void|<!--202200802-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=continuance|location=Palace of Astrum|update|Accompanied by Yanqing, you all finally gained a meeting with Jing Yuan, learning the purpose of the Wardance's revival after the Ambrosial Arbor crisis. You also learned of the generals of the Zhuming and Yaoqing coming forth to observe the ceremony.<br />Their motives were anything but earnest.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Yanqing)
;(If {{cx}}<!--SubMission not Finish: 202200803-->)
::'''Yanqing:''' This is the report Qingzu just sent me. Let me take a look...
::'''Yanqing:''' ...
::'''Yanqing:''' ...
::'''Yanqing:''' Looks like the general has given me a tough challenge. He wants me to try and help put the IPC's mind at ease.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is this some kind of test from the general?
::'''Yanqing:''' Well, it's not exactly a "test." As Cloud Knight officers, we not only learn the art of war and martial arts but also occasionally have to handle diplomatic disputes.
::'''Yanqing:''' It's just, you know... Talking things out isn't as straightforward as duking it out with weapons on the battlefield. This is especially true when you're up against the IPC, with their non-stop corporate babble.
::'''Yanqing:''' Well, let's not worry about that for now. Shall I take you to the inn?
::Not yet.
;(If {{cx}}<!--SubMission Finish: 202200803-->)
::'''Yanqing:''' Well, let's not worry about that for now. Shall I take you to the inn?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Let's go.
